{
  "core_message": "All 155 survived after a bird strike forced a Hudson River ditching.",
  "mood": "curious",
  "title": "155 survived after geese knocked out both engines",
  "description": "A single bird strike sent US Airways Flight 1549 into the Hudson River, yet every passenger survived.  The incident, known as the \"Miracle on the Hudson\", showcases the skill and calm of Captain Sully and the resilience of aviation safety.\n\nKey facts: 155 people aboard, 5 serious injuries, less than four minutes from engine failure to water landing.\n\nBased on the Wikipedia article \"US Airways Flight 1549\" (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/US_Airways_Flight_1549), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.\n\nImages from Wikimedia Commons:\nUS Airways Flight 1549 in Hudson cropped.JPG (Izno , cropped by Falcorian, CC BY-SA 3.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Airways_Flight_1549_in_Hudson_cropped.JPG\nUS Air Flight 1549 rescue efforts.jpg (Photo by Chris Gardner, USACE New York District Public Affairs, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Air_Flight_1549_rescue_efforts.jpg\nUSAirways-1549 lifting out of Hudson.jpg (Spyropk, CC BY-SA 3.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:USAirways-1549_lifting_out_of_Hudson.jpg\nUSAir 1549 bird feather.jpg (National Transportation Safety Board, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:USAir_1549_bird_feather.jpg\nParkingLotMotherCanadaGoose (cropped).jpg (PumpkinSky, CC BY-SA 3.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ParkingLotMotherCanadaGoose_(cropped).jpg\nFlight 1549-OptionsNotTaken.PNG (ChrisnHouston, GFDL): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flight_1549-OptionsNotTaken.PNG\nFlight1549BatteryPark2 crop.jpg (U.S. Coast Guard photo / PA3 Barbara L. Patton, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flight1549BatteryPark2_crop.jpg\nAviacionavion.png (Turkmenistan.airlines.frontview.arp.jpg : elfuser derivative work: Elfuser ( tal, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aviacionavion.png\nUS Airways Flight 1549 (N106US) after crashing into the Hudson River (crop 1).jpg (Greg L, CC BY 2.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Airways_Flight_1549_(N106US)_after_crashing_into_the_Hudson_River_(crop_1).jpg\nUS Airways Flight 1549 in Hudson.JPG (Izno, CC BY-SA 3.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Airways_Flight_1549_in_Hudson.JPG\nUS Airways Flight 1549 (N106US) after crashing into the Hudson River (crop 4).jpg (Greg L, CC BY 2.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Airways_Flight_1549_(N106US)_after_crashing_into_the_Hudson_River_(crop_4).jpg\n\n3D models:\nAirbus A320 by Andre11230 (CC BY 4.0) https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/none-790a19f65d5646539ed975c96fedb313",
